/* 共享视觉：浅灰背景、白色圆角卡片、酒红色主操作，与商品详情、购物袋及提交订单保持一致。 */
.qx {
  background: #f5f4f2;
  color: #2c221e;
  font-family: -apple-system, "PingFang SC", sans-serif;
  font-size: 14px;
  min-height: 100vh;
  padding-bottom: 51.862rpx;
}
.qx button {
  width: auto;
  min-width: 0;
  font: inherit;
  border: 0;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  border-radius: 0;
  line-height: 1.5;
  background: transparent;
  color: inherit;
}
.qx button::after {
  border: 0;
}
.qx-brand {
  height: 155.585rpx;
  display: flex;
  gap: 19.947rpx;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 27.926rpx 43.883rpx 19.947rpx;
}
.qx-brand-logo {
  display: block;
  width: 460rpx;
  height: 135.294rpx;
}
.qx-hero {
  height: 937.5rpx;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.qx-hero-image,
.qx-shade {
  position: absolute;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  inset: 0;
}
.qx-shade {
  background:
    linear-gradient(
      90deg,
      rgba(43, 18, 17, 0.78),
      rgba(52, 19, 19, 0.3) 57%,
      rgba(52, 19, 19, 0)
    ),
    linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(45, 14, 14, 0.26), transparent 50%);
}
.qx-hero-copy {
  position: absolute;
  left: 55.851rpx;
  top: 149.601rpx;
  color: #fff;
  width: calc(100% - 111.702rpx);
}
.qx-overline {
  font-size: 21.941rpx;
  letter-spacing: 9.973rpx;
  color: #ffffffbd;
}
.qx-hero-title {
  font:
    77.793rpx/1.35 -apple-system,
    "PingFang SC",
    sans-serif;
  letter-spacing: 7.979rpx;
  margin-top: 39.894rpx;
  white-space: pre-line;
}
.qx-hero-sub {
  font-size: 23.936rpx;
  color: #ffffffc7;
  letter-spacing: 1.995rpx;
  margin-top: 33.91rpx;
}
.qx .qx-hero-button {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 35.904rpx;
  border: 1.995rpx solid #ffffff8f;
  background: #ffffff14;
  backdrop-filter: blur(15.957rpx);
  padding: 21.941rpx 31.915rpx;
  margin: 55.851rpx auto 0;
  color: white;
  font-size: 23.936rpx;
  letter-spacing: 1.995rpx;
  width: max-content;
}
.qx-hero-button text {
  font-size: 33.91rpx;
}
.qx-shortcuts {
  background: #ffffff;
  display: flex;
  padding: 45.878rpx 27.926rpx;
  border-bottom: 1.995rpx solid #eee9e4;
  gap: 23.936rpx;
}
.qx-shortcuts button {
  flex: 1;
  text-align: center;
  font-size: 23.936rpx;
}
.qx-shortcuts image,
.qx-shortcuts img {
  display: block;
  width: 43.883rpx;
  height: 43.883rpx;
  padding: 21.941rpx;
  box-sizing: content-box;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #f4e4e3;
  margin: 0 auto 17.952rpx;
}
.qx-shortcuts text {
  display: block;
  font-size: 17.952rpx;
  color: #796f68;
  margin-top: 7.979rpx;
}
.qx-section {
  padding: 20px 8px 0;
}
.qx-caption {
  font:
    10px/1.5 -apple-system,
    "PingFang SC",
    sans-serif;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
  color: #796f68;
}
.qx-h2 {
  font:
    600 18px/1.5 -apple-system,
    "PingFang SC",
    sans-serif;
  letter-spacing: 0;
  margin: 4px 0 8px;
}
.qx-section-row {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 15.957rpx;
}
.qx .qx-text {
  color: #7a1c1c;
  font-size: 13px;
  min-height: 44px;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
}
.qx-feature {
  display: flex;
  margin-top: 33.91rpx;
  background: #ede3d5;
  min-height: 478.723rpx;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.qx-feature > image,
.qx-feature > img {
  width: 53%;
  height: 478.723rpx;
  object-fit: cover;
}
.qx-feature-copy {
  flex: 1;
  padding: 47.872rpx 27.926rpx 31.915rpx 13.963rpx;
}
.qx-badge {
  font-size: 11px;
  padding: 3px 8px;
  background: #f5e9e9;
  color: #7a1c1c;
  display: inline-block;
  border-radius: 6px;
}
.qx-feature .qx-h2 {
  font-size: 47.872rpx;
  line-height: 1.38;
  margin-top: 21.941rpx;
}
.qx-muted {
  color: #796f68;
  font-size: 12px;
  line-height: 1.7;
}
.qx-price {
  font:
    600 18px/1.5 -apple-system,
    "PingFang SC",
    sans-serif;
  color: #7a1c1c;
}
.qx-feature .qx-price {
  margin: 27.926rpx 0;
  font-size: 37.899rpx;
}
.qx .qx-primary {
  background: #7a1c1c;
  color: #fff;
  padding: 10px 20px;
  font-size: 14px;
  min-height: 44px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border-radius: 24px;
  line-height: 1.5;
}
.qx-about {
  white-space: pre-line;
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.8;
  color: #796f68;
  margin: 12px 0;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}
.qx .qx-info {
  padding: 47.872rpx;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #55161c, #8a2630);
  color: #f9ede0;
  font:
    35.904rpx/53.856rpx -apple-system,
    "PingFang SC",
    sans-serif;
  letter-spacing: 3.989rpx;
  width: 100%;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
}
.qx-info-arrow {
  width: 18rpx;
  height: 18rpx;
  border-top: 3rpx solid currentColor;
  border-right: 3rpx solid currentColor;
  transform: rotate(45deg);
  flex-shrink: 0;
  margin-left: 24rpx;
}
.qx-shop-head {
  background: #f3ece2;
  padding: 107.713rpx 43.883rpx 55.851rpx;
}
.qx-h1 {
  font:
    600 22px/1.5 -apple-system,
    "PingFang SC",
    sans-serif;
  letter-spacing: 0;
  margin: 8px 0 16px;
}
.qx-role {
  background: #59131b;
  color: #f1dfcd;
  margin: 0 35.904rpx;
  padding: 27.926rpx 31.915rpx;
}
.qx-role text {
  font-size: 17.952rpx;
  letter-spacing: 1.995rpx;
  color: #caa684;
  display: block;
  margin-bottom: 7.979rpx;
}
.qx-categories {
  display: block;
  white-space: nowrap;
  padding: 35.904rpx 35.904rpx 29.92rpx;
  width: 100%;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
.qx-categories button {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  vertical-align: middle;
  min-width: 44px;
  height: 44px;
  padding: 0 28rpx;
  border: 1rpx solid #d5c6b8;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  margin-right: 16rpx;
  background: #ffffff;
  color: #655348;
  font-size: 26rpx;
  font-weight: 500;
  line-height: 1;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.qx-categories button:last-child {
  margin-right: 0;
}
.qx-categories .category-pressed {
  opacity: 0.7;
}
.qx button.chosen {
  background: #7a1c1c;
  color: #fff;
  border-color: #7a1c1c;
}
.qx-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 10px;
  padding: 0 8px 24px;
}
.qx-product {
  background: #ffffff;
  overflow: hidden;
  border-radius: 12px;
}
.qx-product > image,
.qx-product > img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 359.043rpx;
  display: block;
  object-fit: cover;
  border-radius: 5.984rpx;
}
.qx-product-copy {
  padding: 12px;
}
.qx-product-copy > .qx-muted {
  font-size: 15.957rpx;
  letter-spacing: 0.997rpx;
  min-height: 47.872rpx;
}
.qx-product-name {
  font:
    500 14px/1.6 -apple-system,
    "PingFang SC",
    sans-serif;
  letter-spacing: 0;
  margin-top: 9.973rpx;
}
.qx-product .qx-section-row {
  margin-top: 25.931rpx;
}
.qx-add {
  width: 59.84rpx;
  height: 59.84rpx;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  background: #7a1c1c;
  border-radius: 50%;
  padding: 11.968rpx;
}
.qx-empty {
  padding: 64px 16px;
  text-align: center;
  color: #796f68;
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.8;
}
.qx-detail-image {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: 668.218rpx;
  object-fit: cover;
}
.qx-detail-section {
  padding: 43.883rpx 39.894rpx 39.894rpx;
  background: #ffffff;
  margin-bottom: 19.947rpx;
}
.qx-detail-section .qx-h1 {
  font-size: 45.878rpx;
  letter-spacing: 1.995rpx;
  margin-top: 21.941rpx;
}
.qx-large {
  font-size: 43.883rpx;
  line-height: 65.824rpx;
  margin-top: 33.91rpx;
}
.qx-large text {
  font:
    19.947rpx "PingFang SC",
    sans-serif;
  color: #796f68;
}
.qx-label {
  font-weight: 600;
  font-size: 21.941rpx;
  margin-bottom: 21.941rpx;
}
.qx-specs {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 15.957rpx;
  margin-bottom: 35.904rpx;
}
.qx-specs button {
  border: 1.995rpx solid #eee9e4;
  padding: 17.952rpx 27.926rpx;
  font-size: 19.947rpx;
}
.qx-specs button.chosen {
  color: #7a1c1c;
  border-color: #7a1c1c;
  background: #f8ecea;
}
.qx-quantity {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
}
.qx-quantity button,
.qx-quantity text {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.qx-quantity button {
  width: 59.84rpx;
  height: 55.851rpx;
  background: #f6f1eb;
  border: 1.995rpx solid #eee9e4;
}
.qx-quantity text {
  width: 67.819rpx;
  height: 55.851rpx;
  line-height: 1.5;
  text-align: center;
  border-top: 1.995rpx solid #eee9e4;
  border-bottom: 1.995rpx solid #eee9e4;
}
.qx-notes {
  background: #eee2d3;
  padding: 47.872rpx 39.894rpx 63.83rpx;
}
.qx-flow {
  background: #f5f4f2;
  min-height: 100vh;
  padding-bottom: calc(24px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
}
.qx-flow-content {
  padding: 8px 8px 0;
}
.qx-sheet {
  background: #ffffff;
  padding: 18px 16px;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
  border-radius: 12px;
}
.qx-notice {
  background: #f7eceb;
  padding: 12px 14px;
  color: #79615d;
  font-size: 12px;
  line-height: 1.8;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
  border-radius: 8px;
}
.qx-fixed {
  position: fixed;
  bottom: 0;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  z-index: 5;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 19.947rpx;
  min-height: 68px;
  padding: 10px 16px calc(10px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  background: #fff;
  box-shadow: none;
  border-top: 1.995rpx solid #eee9e4;
}
.qx-fixed .qx-primary {
  min-width: 0;
  min-height: 44px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  flex: 1;
}
.qx-fixed > .qx-text {
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.qx-cart-line {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 21.941rpx;
  padding: 33.91rpx 0;
  border-bottom: 1.995rpx solid #eee9e4;
}
.qx-cart-line > image {
  width: 171.543rpx;
  height: 185.505rpx;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.qx-cart-line checkbox {
  transform: scale(0.75);
  width: 39.894rpx;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.qx-line-copy {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
}
.qx-line-copy .qx-badge {
  margin: 11.968rpx 0;
}
.qx-line-copy .qx-quantity {
  justify-content: flex-end;
}
.qx-line-copy .qx-price {
  font-size: 25.931rpx;
}
.qx-line-copy .qx-text {
  font-size: 17.952rpx;
}
.qx-order-line {
  display: flex;
  gap: 23.936rpx;
  margin-top: 29.92rpx;
  padding: 0 0 23.936rpx;
}
.qx-order-line > image {
  width: 139.628rpx;
  height: 151.596rpx;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.qx-order-line > view {
  flex: 1;
  font-size: 19.947rpx;
  line-height: 1.8;
}
.qx-line-end {
  text-align: right;
}
.qx-info-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 27.926rpx;
  border-top: 1.995rpx solid #eee9e4;
  min-height: 44px;
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 1.8;
  padding: 10px 0;
}
.qx-info-row > text:last-child {
  text-align: right;
  max-width: 70%;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}
.qx .qx-wide {
  width: 100%;
  min-height: 44px;
  margin: 14px 0 0;
}
.qx-sheet input {
  width: 100%;
  background: #f5f4f2;
  border-color: #eee9e4;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
  height: 44px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  font-size: 14px;
}
.qx-label {
  margin-top: 10px;
  font-size: 14px;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}
.qx-address {
  min-height: 147.606rpx;
  line-height: 1.8;
}
.qx button[disabled] {
  opacity: 0.5;
}

/* 底部自定义导航及微信安全区。 */
.qx-tabpage {
  padding-bottom: calc(180rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
}
